              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "myangelaliyah"
            },
            "reviewBody": "the first time i ate this my mom called it chocolate pudding the first time then when i ate the whole bowl she says \"opps, sorry it's not chocolate pudding its Paksiw na Pata\" iasked what that was she calls it pig blood. I only eat it every couple months, but it is still good",
